+`ToggleGroupShape`). A pill holds one row (below), so an option that shows a name over a
+readout, or a picture over a name, renders on one row and clips until its group says
+`shape="cell"`. A `cell` item is a tile: the field corner (16px), a column, the card pad
+pair (`--space-atom` / `--space-body`; `sm`: `--space-residue` / `--space-atom`), body
