+fill, `[data-state="on"]` ink rules). A value other than `pill` or `cell` throws
+`[ToggleGroup] shape="…" is not one of pill, cell.` in production as in development; the
+group still renders, as pills. Detector: in development, `[ToggleGroupItem] value=… asks
